            {
                "date": "2024-06-07",
                "text": "This cards was originally printed with the \"tribal\" card type. That card type has been replaced with \"kindred\". This change does not affect the gameplay function of this card."
            },
            {
                "date": "2024-06-07",
                "text": "Kindred is a card type that allows noncreature cards to have creature types. For example, Echoes of Eternity is an Eldrazi (although not a creature) while on the battlefield and an Eldrazi card (although not a creature card) in zones other than the battlefield."
            },
            {
                "date": "2024-06-07",
                "text": "While it appears only on cards that already have other card types, kindred is a card type and will be counted by effects that refer to the number of card types among cards in a zone."
            },
            {
                "date": "2008-04-01",
                "text": "The effect is mandatory. You'll lose 1 life even if you have only 1 life left."
            },
            {
                "date": "2008-04-01",
                "text": "The life loss isn't a payment. You'll get a token even if you had 0 life (and another effect is stopping you from losing the game)."
            }
        ]
    },
